{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — A playful premium take on whole-person care</title>
  <meta name='description' content='Integrative, educational, whole-person intensive programs for lasting resilience and vitality.'>
  <link rel='stylesheet' href='assets/css/styles.css'>
</head>
<body class='layout-split'>
  <header class='site-header'>
    <div class='brand'>
      <a href='index.html' class='logo'>
        <svg viewBox='0 0 120 24' class='logo-mark' aria-hidden='true'>
          <rect x='0' y='0' width='120' height='24' rx='4' fill='url(#g)'></rect>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id='g' x1='0' x2='1'>
              <stop offset='0' stop-color='#7BE495' />
              <stop offset='1' stop-color='#5CA6FF' />
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
        </svg>
        <span class='brand-name'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <nav class='nav' id='main-nav'>
      <button class='nav-toggle' id='nav-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='nav-list'>Menu</button>
      <ul class='nav-list' id='nav-list'>
        <li><a href='index.html'>Home</a></li>
        <li><a href='services.html'>Offerings</a></li>
        <li><a href='conditions.html'>Concerns</a></li>
        <li><a href='approach.html'>How We Work</a></li>
        <li><a href='pricing.html'>Investment</a></li>
        <li><a href='about.html'>Our Story</a></li>
        <li><a href='book.html' class='primary-ghost'>Book An Intensive</a></li>
        <li><a href='contact.html' class='muted'>Reach Out</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class='contact-quick'>
      <a class='phone' href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id='hero' class='hero split'>
      <div class='hero-left'>
        <h1 class='eyebrow'>Meet a kinder way to get well</h1>
        <h2 class='headline'>Intensive integrative care for the whole you</h2>
        <p class='sub'>A focused, education-forward program designed to address root drivers — stress, sleep, digestion, inflammation, and energy — with practical tools, optional testing, and warm follow-up.</p>
        <div class='hero-ctas'>
          <a class='btn primary' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class='btn ghost' href='services.html'>Explore offerings</a>
        </div>
        <p class='meta small'>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
      </div>
      <div class='hero-right' aria-hidden='true'>
        <div class='diagonal-card'>
          <svg class='pattern' viewBox='0 0 400 320' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid slice'>
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id='lg' x1='0' x2='1'>
                <stop offset='0' stop-color='#FFF6EA' />
                <stop offset='1' stop-color='#E7FFF8' />
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(#lg)'></rect>
            <image href='assets/img/pattern.svg' x='0' y='0' width='100%' height='100%'></image>
          </svg>
          <div class='card-copy'>
            <h3>Intensive program — 4 weeks</h3>
            <p class='muted'>A tight, guided series of visits, educational sessions, and targeted plans — ideal if you want to move clearly and quickly toward balance.</p>
            <ul class='list-check'>
              <li>Personalized intake and review</li>
              <li>Evidence-informed lifestyle plan</li>
              <li>Optional lab guidance (educational)</li>
            </ul>
            <a class='btn slim' href='book.html'>Start a conversation</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id='myth_vs_truth' class='section card-grid'>
      <h2 class='section-title'>Myths vs. What Actually Helps</h2>
      <p class='lead'>We love curiosity. Let’s bust a few myths and land on practical truths.</p>
      <div class='grid three'>
        <div class='card'>
          <h4>Myth: Quick fixes heal everything</h4>
          <p class='muted'>Truth: Lasting change usually needs pattern shifts, time, and education — we focus on skills you can use for life, not one-off tricks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class='card'>
          <h4>Myth: Tests tell the whole story</h4>
          <p class='muted'>Truth: Labs can help; they are tools. We interpret them alongside your story, symptoms, and priorities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class='card'>
          <h4>Myth: More supplements = better</h4>
          <p class='muted'>Truth: Thoughtful, minimal interventions and behavioral shifts are where most wins happen.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id='pillars' class='section light'>
      <h2 class='section-title'>Foundational Pillars</h2>
      <p class='lead'>Programs center on three pillars that knit together into a personalized plan.</p>
      <div class='pillars'>
        <div class='pillar'>
          <svg class='icon' viewBox='0 0 48 48' aria-hidden='true'><circle cx='24' cy='24' r='20' fill='#7BE495'></circle></svg>
          <h4>Biology</h4>
          <p class='muted'>Nutrition, sleep, digestion, and inflammation — the body’s language.</p>
        </div>
        <div class='pillar'>
          <svg class='icon' viewBox='0 0 48 48' aria-hidden='true'><rect x='8' y='8' width='32' height='32' rx='6' fill='#5CA6FF'></rect></svg>
          <h4>Behavior</h4>
          <p class='muted'>Habits, stress responses, and routines that shape daily resilience.</p>
        </div>
        <div class='pillar'>
          <svg class='icon' viewBox='0 0 48 48' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M8 36 L24 12 L40 36 Z' fill='#FFD38C'></path></svg>
          <h4>Context</h4>
          <p class='muted'>Environment, relationships, and meaning — the outer frame for healing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id='case_notes' class='section case-notes'>
      <h2 class='section-title'>Illustrative Notes (anonymized)</h2>
      <p class='lead'>Short, playful summaries of how an intensive can reframe a concern. These are examples, not promises.</p>
      <div class='notes'>
        <article class='note'>
          <h4>Case: Midday crash</h4>
          <p class='muted'>Snapshot: 38-year-old, high stress, poor midday energy. Plan: small protein-focused mornings, 15-minute reset breaks, adjusted sleep window. Follow-up: improved energy and fewer cravings in two weeks.</p>
        </article>
        <article class='note'>
          <h4>Case: Sleepless spinning thoughts</h4>
          <p class='muted'>Snapshot: Anxious mind at night. Plan: a five-step wind-down, cognitive reframing, optional salivary rhythm education. Follow-up: consistent 30–45 minute improvement reported at check-in.</p>
        </article>
        <article class='note'>
          <h4>Case: Tummy trouble and bloating</h4>
          <p class='muted'>Snapshot: Intermittent bloating after meals. Plan: food pattern mapping, elimination trial with reintroduction education, gut-directed breathing. Follow-up: clearer symptom patterns and fewer flare days.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class='disclaimer small muted'>These notes are illustrative educational summaries and are not clinical guarantees. Individual results vary.</p>
    </section>

    <section id='faq' class='section faq'>
      <h2 class='section-title'>Frequently Asked (and cheerfully answered)</h2>
      <div class='qa'>
        <details>
          <summary>What is an "intensive" program?</summary>
          <p class='muted'>An intensive is a concentrated, time-bound program with an initial thorough intake, a clear plan, and scheduled follow-ups to build momentum quickly.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do you guarantee a cure?</summary>
          <p class='muted'>No. We focus on education and whole-person plans that support better functioning. We do not promise cures.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Will I need labs?</summary>
          <p class='muted'>Optional. Labs are discussed as educational tools when they can meaningfully inform decisions. They are never required to start.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How do follow-ups work?</summary>
          <p class='muted'>Follow-ups are scheduled check-ins (video or phone) to review progress, troubleshoot, and refine your plan.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id='cta' class='section cta split-cta'>
      <div class='cta-left'>
        <h3>Ready for a focused, kind approach?</h3>
        <p class='muted'>Book a short consultation to see if the intensive path fits your goals. We’ll be clear, candid, and practical.</p>
        <a class='btn primary large' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
      <div class='cta-right'>
        <div class='trust'>
          <p class='small muted'>Questions first? Call <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class='site-footer'>
    <div class='wrap'>
      <p class='muted'>&copy; <span id='year'></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Integrative education-forward care. Not a promise of cure.</p>
      <nav class='fnav'>
        <a href='privacy.html'>Privacy</a>
        <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>
        <a href='sitemap.xml'>Sitemap</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src='assets/js/main.js' defer></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
